WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Gravewright 0.2.1 Alpha — A universal virtual tabletop for RPGs.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Explore Moonfall Abbey and move character tokens through your scene.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Measure distances on the tabletop as you plan the next move.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Keep your campaign notes and discoveries in shared journals.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Follow initiative and advance turns in the combat tracker.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.600
An optional system example: the DnD 5e SRD character sheet.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:47.000
Drag a compendium item onto the compatible system sheet.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Send messages and roll dice, with results directly in chat.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
